roke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-34\" d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-5D\" d=\"M22 710V750H159V-250H22V-210H119V710H22Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJSZ3-5B\" d=\"M247 -949V1450H516V1388H309V-887H516V-949H247Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJSZ3-5D\" d=\"M11 1388V1450H280V-949H11V-887H218V1388H11Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1028\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2084,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJSZ3-5B\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(695,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(-11,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"389\" y=\"650\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-750)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"778\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(2268,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"0\" y=\"650\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"0\" y=\"-750\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJSZ3-5D\" x=\"3631\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"6411\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Notice that:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Since the only (repeated) eigenvalue of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.743ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 750.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">A</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is positive, we have a unstable node. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Since <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.743ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 750.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">A</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is not diagonal and has a repeated eigenvalue, there is only one linearly independent eigenvector. So, we have a degenerate node.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> The phase portrait of the system looks as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-3f407fe5a2055332f131e6ddc696a3a8\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/3f407fe5a2055332f131e6ddc696a3a8\"></div>\n\n                    </div>     \n                </div>                            \n                    \n            </div>",
